# Normalise line endings so the working tree matches the repository on every
# checkout, regardless of the machine's core.autocrlf setting.
#
# Without this, a Windows editor can rewrite a file as LF, a subagent's tooling
# can rewrite it as CRLF, and `git status` then shows phantom whole-file diffs.
# That happened twice during this migration and cost a debugging pass both
# times.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated artefacts -- never committed, and never line-ending sensitive.
node_modules/ -text
.next/ -text
.output/ -text
drizzle/ -text
var/ -text
backup/ -text
.vitest/ -text
